# RiverMind interface art: chips, the dealer button, player avatars and the
# logo emblem. scripts/pixel-art/ui.js colors them and draws the frames.

# --- A chip seen from above, 11 × 11. @chip is its color, with a darker inner
# ring and a lighter face; the edge stripes are white.

legend
. clear
K ink
C @chip
d @chip-dark
L @chip-light
W @stripe

sprite chip
...KKKKK...
.KKCWWWCKK.
.KCCCCCCCK.
KCCdddddCCK
KWCdLLLdCWK
KWCdLLLdCWK
KWCdLLLdCWK
KCCdddddCCK
.KCCCCCCCK.
.KKCWWWCKK.
...KKKKK...

# --- A chip seen edge-on, for stacks: 11 × 4.

sprite chip-edge
.KKKKKKKKK.
KCWCCWCCWCK
KdddddddddK
.KKKKKKKKK.

# --- The dealer button, 11 × 11.

legend
. clear
K ink
W paper
w paper shade
H white

sprite dealer
...KKKKK...
.KKHHHHHKK.
.KHWWWWWwK.
KHWWKKWWWwK
KHWWKWKWWwK
KHWWKWKWWwK
KHWWKWKWWwK
KHWWKKWWWwK
.KWWWWWWwK.
.KKwwwwwKK.
...KKKKK...

# --- Avatars, 16 × 16, outlined in ink by ui.js. People take a skin, hair
# and shirt; bots take a metal and an eye color.

legend
. clear
K ink
B @hair
b @hair-dark
S @skin
s @skin-dark
C @shirt
c @shirt-dark

sprite person
................
.....BBBBBB.....
....BBBBBBBB....
...BBBBBBBBBB...
...BBSSSSSSBb...
...BSSSSSSSSb...
...BSKSSSSKSb...
...SSKSSSSKSs...
...SSSSSSSSSs...
....SSSSSSSs....
....SSsssSSs....
......SSSs......
....CCCSSCCC....
..CCCCCCCCCCcc..
.CCCCCCCCCCCCcc.
.CCCCCCCCCCCCcc.

legend
. clear
K ink
M @metal
m @metal-dark
L @metal-light
E @eye
d deep slate

sprite bot
.......EE.......
.......dd.......
..MMMMMMMMMMMm..
.MLLLLLLLLLLMMm.
.MLKKKKKKKKKKMm.
.MLKEEKKKKEEKMm.
.MLKEEKKKKEEKMm.
.MLKKKKKKKKKKMm.
.MMMMMMMMMMMMMm.
.MMMdMdMdMdMMMm.
.mMMMMMMMMMMMmm.
..mmmmmmmmmmmm..
......dddd......
..MMMMMMMMMMMm..
.MMMMLMMMMLMMMm.
.MMMMMMMMMMMMMm.

# --- The RiverMind emblem: a gold spade crossed by a river, 15 × 17. Used for
# the logo and the favicon.

legend
. clear
K ink
G gold
y gold light
g amber dark
b blue light
B blue

sprite emblem
.......K.......
......KyK......
.....KyGGK.....
....KyGGGGK....
...KyGGGGGGK...
..KyGGGGGGGGK..
.KyGGGGGGGGGgK.
KyGbbGGGGGGGGgK
KbbGGbbGGGGbbbK
KBGGGGGbbbbBGgK
KGGGGGGGGGGGGgK
.KgGGgKGKgGGgK.
..KKKKKGKKKKK..
......KGK......
.....KGGGK.....
....KgggggK....
....KKKKKKK....
